    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "`Pick files` will always show list of files in cwd. How to pick files from different directory without changing cwd.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Pick files</code> will always show list of files in cwd. How to pick files from different directory without changing cwd.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Pick files will always show list of files in cwd. How to pick files from different directory without changing cwd.",
